note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/nmm-init.om: stand-in for gpu/nvidia/om/api/mm_init.om (the same words). A composed program
note has one om2 line, first, and attn_oracle.om, mm_init.om and mm_next.om each carry one. So check nmm takes
note attn_oracle.om as its head with this file and nmm-next.om for the walk, and the walk itself is proven on its
note own table by nmmi (mm_init.om as head, nmm-next.om) and nmmn (mm_next.om as head, this file).
fn mm_init q edit ulong 8 to bool
put q 6 mul get q 4 get q 2
put q 7 mul get q 2 get q 3
ret and gt get q 4 0 gt get q 3 0
end
